OL,3,AThree men found guilty of murdering two
OL,4,AAustralian surfer brothers and US
OL,5,Afriend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men have been found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurdering Australian brothers, Jake and
OL,9,FCallum Robinson, and their American
OL,10,Ffriend Carter Rhoad during a surfing
OL,11,Ftrip in Mexico in 2024.
OL,13,FDuring the trial, the court heard the
OL,14,Ftourists were killed in an apparent
OL,15,Fbotched robbery of their truck in a
OL,16,Fsecluded beach area. Their bodies were
OL,17,Flater found with gunshot wounds to
OL,18,Ftheir heads, dumped down a well.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
