OL,3,AThree men found guilty of murdering two
OL,4,AAustralian surfer brothers and US
OL,5,Afriend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe murders sent shockwaves around the
OL,8,Fworld, particularly in Australia, as
OL,9,Fthe coastal area is usually safe from
OL,10,Fthe violence in other parts of Mexico.
OL,12,FThe verdict was handed down on Friday
OL,13,Fin the Mexican state of Baja
OL,14,FCalifornia.
